   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">02 November 2013, KIROKA, TANZANIA   -  Mwajuma Ramadhani weeds a rice paddy which uses the SRI technique. A FAO project to strengthen capacity of farms for climate change is underway in Kiroka, Tanzania.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
