   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">01 November 2013, KIROKA, TANZANIA  -  Habiba Msonga examines her rice paddy. After using the System of Rice Intensification (SRI)  method,  Msonga was able to finish building her home and is planning on becoming one of the first homes with electricity in the area.</rdf:li>
