     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">04 June 2015, Rusumo, Tanzania - Pupils of the Magereza Elementary School in Rusumo use dry leaves to cover the grounds of a banana farm on the school premises during a class of the Farmer Field School program. The technique called</rdf:li>
